rs towards the camera  accompanied by the character's typical  maniacal laughter  needless to say the only returnee who  can actually be seen as doc ock  appearing in a spectacular fight scene  and addressing peter directly a truly  epic moment that gives you goosebumps  after a very long cinema-free period  cinemacon in las vegas is at least a  glimmer of hope again for movie fans  around the globe of course among the top  class films that will be released in the  coming year one cannot be missing the  batman med reef's standalone film has  been causing commotion since its very  early announcement in 2015 initially  mostly negative many fans were bothered  by robert patterson signing for the  leading role but in the meantime the  hype has grown bigger than ever in order  to keep the fan spirits up walnut  brothers released what is now the second  trailer for the dc spectacle besides  scenes from the movie behind the scenes  footage was also shown in las vegas as  well gotham city seems to sing the chaos  in the trailer while dramatic music  plays on the background pattinson  himself comments that the batman we will  see in the finished film will be  radically different from the previous  cinematic characters reeves also asked  that it will be an emotional movie based  on the batman year one comic by frank  miller and david mazzakelli moreover  there are fight scenes between batman  and catwoman in the trailer which have a  very personal touch also andy circus can  be seen in his role as alfred of course  in proper style with a vest and white  hair  eventually the trailer ends with a  badmobile revving up its engine and a  few porting words from director med  reeves we can't wait to see the trailer  with their own eyes and look forward to  the release of the dc blockbuster on  march 4th 2022  speculation about the title has been  going on for a long time but now with  cinemacon it was indeed confirmed that  the 4th matrix installment will carry  the title the matrix resurrections  in keeping with this there was even a  first trailer which was shown  exclusively in las vegas so we must rely  on eyewitness report our summary is  based primarily on coverage from the  outlet screenrant and the hollywood  reporter  the story is set in the san francisco of  the future and features a thomas  anderson who apparently has no memory of  the events of the past three films he's  undergoing treatment by a psychiatrist  who's played by neil patrick harris and  is diligently consuming blue pills as he  keeps seeing the matrix codes in his  surroundings  in a store neil then meets his companion  trinity whom he of course also doesn't  recognize  later a young morpheus shows up and  gives neil the red pill where pawnee  follows a strange person with a bunny  tattoo through a mirror we assume that  this is the german actor max riemold  these opening scenes are immediately  followed by hard-hitting action and good  old matrix style including martial arts  slow motion and telekinetic powers  the trailer ends with neo meeting a man  in a suit who advises him to return to  the matrix all sounds pretty exciting  though clearly the question is when will  we be able to see the trailer looking at  spider-man no way home a secret trailer  can turn into a video available to the  whole movie world in no time all  depending on the respective marketing  strategy of course  we strongly expect a prompt release  after all the film will already hit  theaters on december 22nd  be sure to activate the notification  bell on our channel because the release  is just a matter of time  cinemacon not only had a brand new  trailer for matrix 4 up its sleeve but  also fresh footage of the upcoming  jurassic world dominion  since both trailers are not yet intended  for the public we have to settle for  eyewitness reports from those present on  site and they promise a lot for the  third and final installment of the  jurassic world series  in the trailer shown by universal in las  vegas we pleasingly do not only see the  jurassic world cast around chris brett  bryce dallas howard and the likes but  also the stars of the very first  jurassic park film from 1993 namely  laura dern sam neil bidi wong as well as  jeff goldblum  more or less the story is clear because  after the dinosaurs have scattered to  all parts of the world they pose a huge  threat to humans  that's exactly what the trailer picks up  on so for example you can see chris  pratt and bryce dallas howard during a  wild chase with dinosaurs on a snowy  peak in general the trailer seems to be  full of action including giant dinosaurs  in cities and a mosasaurus rising from  the ocean and devouring an entire  helicopter the animations are said to  look stunning mostly due to really good  mix of cgi and practical effects  well all sounds very promising and we  hope to be able to show you the  full-length trailer on our channel soon  sadly we don't know when exactly that  will be at this time  jurassic world dominion will be released  in theories on june 10th 2022  last year the death of chadwick boseman  cast a cloud over the entire film world  respecting the legacy of the king's  cella actor disney decided not to recast  his role obviously no one can fill the  void he left behind nevertheless there  is an important new addition for the  sequel as marvel boss kevin feige  recently confirmed in an interview with  comicbook.com the character erie  williams aka ironheart will finally make  her mcu movie debut  in the same breath he announced that she  will be played by american actress  dominic thorne who already started  shooting her own iron heart series last  week  people like to speak out riri williams  as an iron man successor and for good  reason she is a very talented inventor  who studies at the world famous mit and  in the comics she's even supported by  tony stark himself  much like a role model she built her own  improved ironman suit and is logically  highly technically adept  speculation has it that she will first  debut as river williams in black panther  2 and then become the superhero  ironheart in the disney plus series  black panther wakanda forever will be  out in theaters starting july 8th 2022  while the ironheart series will be  released later as a result  the anime cowboy bebop has been one of  the best of its kind since its release  in 1998. all the better that fans will  finally get to see live-action adaption  on netflix starting in november after  the three-year stage of development at  least there are now images of the series  which give us a very first impression  among others john joe can be seen as  former red dragon member spike spiegel  daniela pineda as bounty hunter faye  valentine and masterful shakir as  ex-police officer jet black  another loyal member of the bebop crew  is the corki ein who can be seen next to  fey in one of the pictures the dog's  peculiarity is not only its cute  appearance but especially its extremely  high intelligence it's not for nothing  that the name iron comes from its  namesake albert einstein even though  many anime fans are traditionally  critical of live action adaptions it  needs to be said that the images shown  are quite harmonious and atmospheric  speaking of atmosphere the composer of  the original kalioku will also be adding  the final touch to the netflix series  with their jazzy and melancholic works  director watanabe shinichiro is also  coming back serving as an advisor to  producers andrei nemik and jeff pinkner  the first season of cowboy bebop will  consist of 10 episodes and will be  available on netflix from november 19  2021  the expandables movie series is  primarily known for two things badass  action and big names after three parts  so far a few weeks ago there was a  rather odd photo of sylvester stallone  with a distinctive ring of his character  now he has followed up with more  information about the sequel likewise on  social media stallone published a  photograph of her tattoo on which his  character barney ross is visible in the  image description he further informs  that filming on a spin-off will begin in  october and that it will bear the  working title of christmas story of  course this doesn't necessarily mean  that it will be christmasy in fact it's  more of a reference to the character  early christmas who will be portrayed by  jason statham  fans of brute force who may not have  gotten their money's worth in the  expandables 3 can expect a slightly  harsher a trading again in the upcoming  film  unfortunately there is neither release  date no more detailed information  regarding the content but we will of  course keep you up to date  that's it for today thanks for watching  if you want to know more about the  upcoming the matrix 4 check out our  recently published original episode  where we are talking about some crazy  story theories for the highly  anticipated sequel  see you next time  [Music]  you

